<title>JAPAN: Marubun to list on Tokyo bourse on Jan 29.</title>
<headline>Marubun to list on Tokyo bourse on Jan 29.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Marubun Corp will list on the second section of the Tokyo Stock Exchange (TSE) on January 29, the bourse said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>The retailer of semiconductor and electronic equipment will offer a total of 2.2 million new shares, with 1.2 million of that offered via auction, the TSE said.</p>
<p>It also said 200,000 existing shares would also be offered. The payment date is January 20.</p>
</text>
